Output "OUT_DIR/choose.gif"
Set Shell zsh
Set FontSize 20
Set Width 1200
Set Height 520
Set Padding 28
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 45ms
Hide
Type "source DEMO_DIR/zshrc && clear" Enter
Sleep 1s
Show
Sleep 600ms
Type "?? show what is listening on port 8080"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Wait+Screen@60s /Press/
Sleep 2s
Type "1"
Sleep 3s
